[I] Shine: fast fixed-point mp3 encoding

[T] shine is a fast mp3 encoding library implemented in fixed-point
[T] arithmetic. It allows fast mp3 encoding on architectures without an FPU,
[T] such as armel, while also being fast on systems with one.

[U] https://github.com/toots/shine

[A] Shine Authors
